---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Forever Anvil"
  description="Forever Anvil privacy policy: no accounts, no personal data collected, trackers saved only in your browser."
  page="privacy"
>
  <PageHero icon="privacy" eyebrow="Privacy" title="Privacy policy">
    Short version: we don't have accounts, we don't collect your personal data, and your saved builds and plans stay on your own device.
  </PageHero>

  <div class="wrap section">
    <div class="panel legal-text">
      <p class="faint">Last updated: <time datetime="2026-11-19">November 19, 2026</time></p>

      <h2>What stays on your device</h2>
      <p>Your display settings, chosen region and filters, talent builds and crafting plan are saved in your browser's local storage. They never leave your device and we can't see them. Clearing your browser data deletes them.</p>

      <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
      <p>Forever Anvil has no sign-up, no login and no contact forms. We don't run our own analytics or tracking.</p>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <p>When you load a page, your browser contacts these services directly. They may receive your IP address and browser details under their own privacy policies:</p>
      <ul class="gems">
        <li><b>Hosting provider</b>: serves the pages and may keep standard server logs for security.</li>
        <li><b>Wowhead</b>: provides spell icons and hover tooltips on some pages. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wowhead privacy policy</a></li>
        <li><b>Google AdSense</b> (if ads are enabled): may use cookies to show and measure ads. Where the law requires it, you'll be asked for consent first. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">how Google uses data from sites that use its services</a>; you can manage ad personalisation at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ad Settings</a>.</li>
        <li><b>Donation platform</b> (if you choose to donate): handled entirely by that platform; we never see your payment details.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>The site's fonts are served by our own hosting, so loading a page doesn't contact a font service.</p>

      <h2>Game data from Blizzard</h2>
      <p>The tools show data from the Blizzard Developer API, such as auction prices and public character profiles. That data is provided by Blizzard Entertainment, is kept for no more than 30 days, and is never sold or passed to advertisers. The character lookup sends the name you type to Blizzard to fetch that public profile; we keep a copy for at most 15 minutes and don't save what you searched. You can ask us to hide a character, and we will stop showing it and delete any cached copy.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Forever Anvil is not aimed at children under 13.</p>

      <h2>Your rights and contact</h2>
      <p>Because we don't store personal data about you, there is usually nothing for us to hand over or delete. For any privacy question or removal request, contact us using the details on the <a href="/about">About page</a>.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, we'll update the date at the top of this page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
